### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4566/api

### 1. Root Ping / Hello
GET http://localhost:4566/api

### 2. Login as Demo User (Colin)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "colin@muster.ch",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Store Token from login response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Get Current User Profile (with Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Get All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Get Single User By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/7f4d1c8e-2f1a-4c6d-9a12-8b4e5d7c1234
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Get My Tours (Authorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tours/my-tours
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Get Tour By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tours/7f4d1c8e-2f1a-4c6d-9a12-8b4e5d7c1234
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Create a New Tour
# @name createTour
POST {{baseUrl}}/tours
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pazolastock Skitour",
  "date": "2026-04-12",
  "time": "07:30",
  "location": "Andermatt Bahnhof",
  "difficulty": "mittel",
  "altitude": "1450m"
}

### 9. Change Participant Role on Tour
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tours/7f4d1c8e-2f1a-4c6d-9a12-8b4e5d7c1234/users/1a2b3c4d-1111-4444-8888-123456789abc/role
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "admin"
}

### 10. Remove User from Tour
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tours/7f4d1c8e-2f1a-4c6d-9a12-8b4e5d7c1234/users/3c4d5e6f-3333-4444-8888-987654abcdef
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
